# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone with the default core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF
# in the working tree while the blobs stay LF. Prettier's `endOfLine: "lf"`
# then reports every file as unformatted, so `npm run format:check` passes in
# CI (Linux) and can never pass locally - and `npm run format` rewrites the
# endings that git immediately converts back.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git shouldn't inspect or convert.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
